        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are organized to handle many of the administrative functions at our home office location so that our Property Management segment operations can focus on business development and the effective development of job placements and recruiting and assignment of field talent.",
