        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we continue to develop the BGSF University, our goal is to provide a variety of learning channels including instructor-led, facilitated custom workshops, leader-led, cohort and mentorships, self-paced, e-learning and a catalog of vendor-provided courses, videos, resources, and books.",
